# Live Order Tracking for Customer App — Swiggy/Zomato-Style

Implement a premium live tracking experience on the customer order detail page, showing the **full delivery journey** with two distinct route segments:

1. **Delivery Partner → Seller** (pickup phase): shown as an **animated fly dotted line** (orange/green dashed)
2. **Seller → Customer** (delivery phase): shown as a **solid polyline** (brand green)

The map will show **all 3 markers** (customer, seller, delivery partner) at all times, with the delivery partner moving live.

## Reference Design

Based on the provided requirement: full-screen map with 3 pins (Customer, Seller, Rider), dotted line for pickup leg, solid polyline for delivery leg, floating ETA card, and a Route View legend panel. This mirrors the `DeliveryTrackingMap` but adapted for the customer view.

